/* Offset gcregNNInstWord50
** ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~ */

/* Set 2nd image Stream Buffer start address in VIPSRAM for Stream Mode The   **
** 2nd image Stream Buffer start address need align tp 256 Byte(VS physic     **
